                                "_id": "accrow1",
                                "item_title": "What makes a useful starting point?",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>Start with a clear purpose, a small set of priorities and room to explore. A shared brief gives every decision a useful point of reference.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "_id": "accrow2",
                                "item_title": "How do we shape the first draft?",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>We turn the brief into a focused direction, then refine the details that make it feel considered and easy to use.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "_id": "accrow3",
                                "item_title": "Where does feedback fit?",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>We review the work together at agreed milestones. Specific examples help us turn your feedback into practical improvements.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "_id": "accrow4",
                                "item_title": "When is the work ready?",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>A final review checks the content, interactions and details. We leave you with an organised handover and clear next steps.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
